This project ports the R package KernSmooth to Python. The
KernSmooth/ subdirectory contains an unmodified copy of the original
R package (v. 2.23-26), which retains its own upstream license and
attribution; see KernSmooth/DESCRIPTION and KernSmooth/LICENCE.note.
By agreement with Dr Matt Wand (1998-06-22), the KernSmooth R port may
be used and distributed freely, and KernSmooth is released on CRAN
under these same "Unlimited" terms, which this repository's original
content adopts for consistency. The r2py_kernsmooth/ subdirectory
additionally carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE files, since it is
also distributed independently as a standalone Python package.

